.TH MARBOR\-BENCHMARK 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-benchmark \- run/inspect in\-dashboard hardware benchmark jobs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor benchmark
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
run/inspect in\-dashboard hardware benchmark jobs
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B run <node> <model>
start a benchmark job
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-n int
number of cold/warm samples (1-50, default 10)
.RE
.TP
.B progress <job\-id>
show a point\-in-time snapshot of a running benchmark job
.TP
.B cancel <job\-id>
cancel an in\-flight benchmark job
.TP
.B runs
show persisted benchmark run history
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
